Package: bentrix
Type: Package
Title: Bentrix for R: Its MCP Client, and Its Engine in Your Own Session
Version: 0.1.361
Description: Every capability of a running Bentrix, over its Model Context Protocol endpoint: the
    client finds the application, pairs with it and calls its tools, generated from Bentrix's
    capability catalogue. And Bentrix's engine in your own R session through its C ABI: the venue,
    the replay clock that cannot look ahead, the recordings, and the Gym as a client of Bentrix's
    own environment. The engine's library is opened on its first use, never at install, so the
    client needs no library.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: curl, jsonlite, tools, utils
NeedsCompilation: yes
SystemRequirements: for the engine in your own session only, Bentrix's engine library
    (libbentrix), installed with Bentrix and found at run time: the file BENTRIX_FFI names, or
    libbentrix in the folder BENTRIX_FFI_DIR names, or on Windows Bentrix's own folder.
Collate: 'generated.R' 'client.R' 'bench.R' 'forecast.R' 'output.R' 'bentrix.R'
